    "title": "Mountain Life",
    "description": "Ooty is about 2700 meters above sea level. It doesn't snow there. However, during the winter season, the grasslands are covered with frost and the temperature in the mornings would drop to zero. In spite of all these challenges, the laborers continue to go to work at their usual time. I went to document this in the neighborhood and found this person walking to his workplace.",
